title: Teleporter
---
ARLO: Something has halted ARLO in its journey.
Lyre: What is it?
ARLO: ARLO does not possess the means to elevate itself upon this ledge.
Lyre: You.. can't jump?
ARLO: Negative.
Lyre: There should be a portal nearby.
ARLO: Negative. The portal the visitor refers to is powered off.
Lyre: Uh, right. I'll look for a gem to power it.
===
